OL,3,AStock up on food to prepare for extreme
OL,4,Aweather, minister says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe NAO said the government was too
OL,7,Freliant on the private sector to deal
OL,8,Fwith food supply disruption. The
OL,9,Fgovernment is due to unveil a strategy
OL,10,Fabout preparing for national
OL,11,Femergencies later this year.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
