OL,3,AJudge in Lindsay Clancy trial refuses
OL,4,Ato remove juror who defence says is
OL,5,Ablocking unanimous verdict
OL,6,
OL,7,FClancy, 36, is charged with three
OL,8,Fcounts of first-degree murder in the
OL,9,Fdeaths of her three children - Cora, 5,
OL,10,FDawson, 3, and eight-month-old Callan -
OL,11,Fat their Massachusetts family home on
OL,12,F24 January 2023
OL,14,FShe does not deny killing them, but her
OL,15,Flawyer argues she was suffering from
OL,16,Fpostpartum psychosis, and could not
OL,17,Fdistinguish right from wrong
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
